<title>USA: Capstone Pharmacy names Shelton CFO.</title>
<headline>Capstone Pharmacy names Shelton CFO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capstone Pharmacy Services Inc said it has named Jim Shelton as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Shelton joined Capstone after serving as CFO at Allied Pharmacy Management, a long term care and hospital pharmacy provider recently acquired by Cardinal Health.</p>
<p>Shelton replaces Don Hughes, who is leaving the company to take a position with an investment company in Maryland.</p>
